    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a suspenseful mine escape in [<strong>Mine</strong>]. Explore the deep underground by yourself and try to escape, or call salvation to the earth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There's only one life</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek escape routes risking against the backdrop of complex tunnels, collapsed shafts, and a heart sound coming from somewhere. Open the doors, find a warehouse, and try to escape by climbing the stairs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Darkness and creeping terror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The darker and darker vision makes the player nervous. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The topography of the stone-stacked mine makes the player disorientated and interferes with escape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember the terrain by fixing the flashlight with a battery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe there's a rule?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple items and 2 choices</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix the radio at the shelter, contact the ground</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go directly to the ground. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you find true freedom?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stemina exists in running</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running might be a solution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But people can't run forever</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then it wouldn't be a bad idea to find a place to hide.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a suspenseful mine escape in [<strong>Mine</strong>]. Explore the deep underground by yourself and try to escape, or call salvation to the earth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There's only one life</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek escape routes risking against the backdrop of complex tunnels, collapsed shafts, and a heart sound coming from somewhere. Open the doors, find a warehouse, and try to escape by climbing the stairs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Darkness and creeping terror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The darker and darker vision makes the player nervous. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The topography of the stone-stacked mine makes the player disorientated and interferes with escape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember the terrain by fixing the flashlight with a battery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe there's a rule?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple items and 2 choices</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix the radio at the shelter, contact the ground</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go directly to the ground. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you find true freedom?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stemina exists in running</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running might be a solution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But people can't run forever</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then it wouldn't be a bad idea to find a place to hide.</p>",
